---
const metrics = [
  { label: 'Active', value: '4', tone: 'text-status-running' },
  { label: 'Succeeded', value: '128', tone: 'text-signal' },
  { label: 'Failed', value: '2', tone: 'text-status-failed' },
  { label: 'Cache hit rate', value: '71%', tone: 'text-ink' },
];
---

<section class="border-t border-hairline px-5 py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-ink-faint">Control room</span>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-[28px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink">Watch the fleet, not the logs</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
        A standalone dashboard — separate binary, separate Docker image —
        renders every worker as a live heartbeat trace, colored by its
        circuit-breaker state. Click through any build to a per-task timeline
        and its raw console output.
      </p>
      <a href="/docs/dashboard" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-signal hover:underline">
        See the dashboard docs →
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-xl border border-hairline-strong bg-surface p-5 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.45)]">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4">
        {metrics.map((metric) => (
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-raised p-3">
            <div class="text-[9px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-ink-faint">{metric.label}</div>
            <div class={`mt-1 font-tabular text-[20px] font-semibold ${metric.tone}`}>{metric.value}</div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-raised p-4">
        <div class="mb-3 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-ink-faint">Live heartbeat</div>
        {[0, 1, 2].map((i) => (
          <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 last:mb-0">
            <div class="w-24 shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] text-ink-secondary">worker-{i + 1}</div>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 200 24" class="h-6 flex-1 text-signal" preserveAspectRatio="none">
              <polyline
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.4"
                points={Array.from({ length: 24 }, (_, n) => {
                  const seed = (i + 1) * 13 + n * 7;
                  const y = 12 + Math.sin(seed) * 7 + (Math.sin(seed * 2.3) * 3);
                  return `${n * 8.6},${y.toFixed(1)}`;
                }).join(' ')}
              />
            </svg>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
